  "details": "Bit earlier a buddy and me found out that the new hotkeys on desktop cause other users avatar gestures to activate. \nThis only affects the local users client, the other user doesn't see their gestures triggering, nor does anyone else, this only happens with the Shift F1-F8 key gestures.\n\nThe screenshot below is of my friend hitting their gesture key, I couldn't see my gun out during this, we had another desktop user try it and it showed up for them as well.",
